; Local signed root zone for the lab: resolvers reach the six variant zones by
; ordinary delegation from here (FINDINGS INFRA.7, INFRA.8). docker/pipeline.sh up
; writes root.zone = this template + one DS record per variant zone, computed from
; that zone's key. Resolvers get docker/root.hints and this zone's key as their
; only trust anchor. Served by the "root" container at 172.30.0.11.
$ORIGIN .
$TTL 300
@                   SOA   a.root.lab. hostmaster.root.lab. 1 1800 900 604800 60
@                   NS    a.root.lab.
a.root.lab.         A     172.30.0.11

; Delegations to the responder (172.30.0.10), one per variant zone, with glue.
nsec.test.          NS    ns1.nsec.test.
ns1.nsec.test.      A     172.30.0.10
nsec3.test.         NS    ns1.nsec3.test.
ns1.nsec3.test.     A     172.30.0.10
minnsec.test.       NS    ns1.minnsec.test.
ns1.minnsec.test.   A     172.30.0.10
minnsec3.test.      NS    ns1.minnsec3.test.
ns1.minnsec3.test.  A     172.30.0.10
cdoe-nsec.test.     NS    ns1.cdoe-nsec.test.
ns1.cdoe-nsec.test. A     172.30.0.10
cdoe-nsec3.test.    NS    ns1.cdoe-nsec3.test.
ns1.cdoe-nsec3.test. A    172.30.0.10

; DS records (generated):
